[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_EAST_ROUTE]
East Route

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_EAST_ROUTE_desc]
Led by the §CEquestrian Liberation Front§!, the “§CEast Route§!” plan has been formally established and now sends invitations to countries that are wary of or openly opposed to the §YEquestrian Empire§!.

The §CEast Route§! starts in eastern Equestria and builds sea lanes to ports across other countries and regions, linking them through a chain of §Cstations§!. The §CLiberation Front§! hopes to use the route to request support for Equestria's resistance, spread Harmony, and encourage economic exchange between countries.

As long as we §Ycontrol§! the station in our territory, we can use the East Route to send aid or ask for help.

Route efficiency/efficiency limit: [?C08.VAR_C08_EAST_ROUTE|C]/[?C08.VAR_C08_EAST_ROUTE_MAX|Y]

Potential member countries:
Liberation Front: [GetEastRouteC08Location]
Griffons: [GetEastRouteC19Location]
Dragons: [GetEastRouteC20Location]
Kirin: [GetEastRouteC18Location]
Storm Island: [GetEastRouteC23Location]
Hippogriffs-Seaponies: [GetEastRouteC28Location]

